# --- Simulation Artifacts ---
# Ignores all waveform dumps and compiled simulation binaries in any directory
**/*.vcd
**/*.vvp
**/*.shm/
**/*.dsn
**/*.trn

# --- Compiled Executables ---
# This catches that "Type: File" junk (usually named 'a.out' or 'simv')
**/a.out
**/simv
**/csrc/

# --- Tool Specific Junk (Vivado/Quartus/Intel) ---
# Ignores logs, journals, and temporary directories
**/*.log
**/*.jou
**/*.str
**/*.pb
**/*.dir/
**/.Xil/
**/obj_dir/
**/*.bak

# --- System & OS Junk ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db